# CVE-2026-14456 -- openssl: DoS via unbounded memory growth in the QUIC server.
# Fixed upstream in libcrypto3/libssl3 3.5.8-r0, but Alpine 3.24 (currently the
# latest stable release) has not published that package yet, so `apk add` still
# resolves 3.5.7-r0 and there is no newer base image to move to.
# Not reachable here: this image runs smbd, not a QUIC server.
# The base image is digest-pinned in the Dockerfile, so Dependabot will open the
# real bump once Alpine rebuilds 3.24 -- DROP THIS LINE in that PR.
# Added 2026-08-29. Re-check by 2026-10-01.
CVE-2026-14456
